<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1340) <span class="when">Oct 5, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li>Movies show their real frame numbers when the file says what they are; otherwise they start at 1. Playback ▸ First Frame Number… sets one if you need to.</li>
<li>The review page: click the timecode to switch to frame numbers.</li>
<li>Playlist: the line joining a pair switches its compare off and on.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1311) <span class="when">Oct 4, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: ending a compare from the review page now clears it here too.</li>
<li>Playlist: click the line joining a pair to clear its compare. The pair stays.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1286) <span class="when">Oct 4, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: undoing a mark didn't reach the others in the review. It does now.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1278) <span class="when">Oct 4, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Comments written on a phone or tablet show a small device icon beside the author.</li>
<li>Fixed: with the notes open, the control bar could run over the notes panel.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1271) <span class="when">Oct 4, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>The control bar always fits its window, and making the window smaller no longer moves it for good.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1264) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> pausing a review you lead could leave the others one frame ahead of you.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1259) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1255) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> clips whose picture starts a moment after their sound couldn't be shared or exported (“Cannot Open”).</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
